# =====================================================================
# DATA POLICY  (PUBLIC method repo), CODE-ONLY
#   This PUBLIC repository publishes the CODE and analysis PIPELINE only,
#   plus the literature-derived life-history PARAMETERS the pipeline needs.
#   NO field data, NO merged datasets, NO generated outputs (results,
#   figures, interactive maps, specimen catalogue), and NO manuscript are
#   published here: the raw records carry GPS coordinates, specimen photos,
#   and third-party angler names. The full data + manuscript live in a
#   separate PRIVATE repository for examination. Bring your own data to run.
# =====================================================================

# Raw field data (sensitive: GPS coordinates + specimen photos)
/all_records/
/historical_tagging/

# Merged individual-record datasets (built from the raw data)
/combined_records/
/combined_dataset.csv

# All generated outputs (tables, figures, interactive maps, photo catalogue)
/results/
/graphs and maps/
/catalog/

